{"id":"198879e40a0ec5d9","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-matchedgraph.md","title":"Matched graph and its vertex covers","display":"df-matchedgraph — Matched graph and its vertex covers","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-matchedgraph","aliases":["27-df-matchedgraph"],"display":"df-matchedgraph — Matched graph and its vertex covers","depends_on":["[[27-df-quadfunc]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§5.4.2","source_statement":"Matched graph preceding Theorem 5.3","source_printed_pages":"210–211","source_pdf_pages":"234–235","verification_status":"source-definition-checked","local_review_status":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-matchedgraph"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-matchedgraph</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-matchedgraph — Matched graph and its vertex covers"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"923be44c9742df37\" href=\"?note=923be44c9742df37\" title=\"27-df-quadfunc\">27-df-quadfunc</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§5.4.2"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"Matched graph preceding Theorem 5.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"210–211"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"234–235"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n\">\\(D\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_\\varnothing\\notin D\">\\(T_\\varnothing\\notin D\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"923be44c9742df37\" href=\"?note=923be44c9742df37\" title=\"27-df-quadfunc\">27-df-quadfunc</a>）；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\(N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lit}_n,\\mathrm{Lits},x_i,\\bar x_i\">\\(\\mathrm{Lit}_n,\\mathrm{Lits},x_i,\\bar x_i\\)</span> 取该 DNF 接口含义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E_D^M\\coloneqq\\{\\{x_i,\\bar x_i\\}\\mid i\\in N\\}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{Lits}(T)\\mid T\\in D\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{MatchedGraph}(D)\\coloneqq(\\mathrm{Lit}_n,E_D^M).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E_D^M\\coloneqq\\{\\{x_i,\\bar x_i\\}\\mid i\\in N\\}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{Lits}(T)\\mid T\\in D\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{MatchedGraph}(D)\\coloneqq(\\mathrm{Lit}_n,E_D^M).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MCover}(D)\\coloneqq\\{C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Lit}_n\\mid\\forall e\\in E_D^M\\;(e\\cap C\\neq\\varnothing)\\},\\qquad\\tau_M(D)\\coloneqq\\min_{C\\in\\mathrm{MCover}(D)}|C|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{MCover}(D)\\coloneqq\\{C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Lit}_n\\mid\\forall e\\in E_D^M\\;(e\\cap C\\neq\\varnothing)\\},\\qquad\\tau_M(D)\\coloneqq\\min_{C\\in\\mathrm{MCover}(D)}|C|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C_n(a)\\coloneqq\\{\\ell\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_n\\mid\\ell(a)=0\\}\\;(a\\in\\mathbb B^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C_n(a)\\coloneqq\\{\\ell\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_n\\mid\\ell(a)=0\\}\\;(a\\in\\mathbb B^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §5.4.2 的 matched graph：n 条互补文字边是 null edges；二文字项对应二元素边，一文字项对应 singleton loop。E_D^M 的边大小为 1 或 2，故这里不调用只接受 simple graph 的 Graph 谓词。排除空项后所有边非空，因此全体文字构成 vertex cover，τ_M 的有限最小值有定义。C_n(a) 是赋值为假的文字集合。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-quadfunc","status":"resolved","id":"923be44c9742df37","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-quadfunc]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-quadfunc","status":"resolved","id":"923be44c9742df37","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$D\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n$ 且 $T_\\varnothing\\notin D$（see [[27-df-quadfunc]]）；$N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$，$\\mathrm{Lit}_n,\\mathrm{Lits},x_i,\\bar x_i$ 取该 DNF 接口含义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"D\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"T_\\varnothing\\notin D","display":false},{"tex":"N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lit}_n,\\mathrm{Lits},x_i,\\bar x_i","display":false},{"tex":"E_D^M\\coloneqq\\{\\{x_i,\\bar x_i\\}\\mid i\\in N\\}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{Lits}(T)\\mid T\\in D\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{MatchedGraph}(D)\\coloneqq(\\mathrm{Lit}_n,E_D^M).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MCover}(D)\\coloneqq\\{C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Lit}_n\\mid\\forall e\\in E_D^M\\;(e\\cap C\\neq\\varnothing)\\},\\qquad\\tau_M(D)\\coloneqq\\min_{C\\in\\mathrm{MCover}(D)}|C|.","display":true},{"tex":"C_n(a)\\coloneqq\\{\\ell\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_n\\mid\\ell(a)=0\\}\\;(a\\in\\mathbb B^n).","display":true}],"bytes":1823,"backlinks":[{"id":"448689b85eeddd41","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"对应原书 Appendix A.1 的无自环有限图片段；空顶点集允许。书中偶尔也允许 loops；此处 Graph 明确只表示 simple graph，[[27-df-matchedgraph]] 的 loop 数据单独表示，避免把 loops 塞入二元素边集合。"},{"id":"226d4e217415a6b5","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"这是本地辅助表示：二次项作为边，一次项作为 marked vertices，空项作为 Boolean flag。旧二元表示在含空项时会丢失信息，现补入 ε_D 后对所有二次 DNF 都可恢复。它不是原书 §5.4.2 的 matched graph；原书还加入互补文字间的 null edges，并用 loops 表示一次项，见 [[27-df-matchedgraph]]。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-258","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-matchedgraph|df-matchedgraph — Matched graph and its vertex covers]]"},{"id":"521d1975363681b1","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$D\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n$ 且 $T_\\varnothing\\notin D$；$\\mathrm{MCover}(D),\\tau_M(D),C_n$（see [[27-df-matchedgraph]]），$\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n$ 取该依赖中的 DNF 语义。"}],"outgoing":["923be44c9742df37"]}